==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**28,300 grants +5 Legend Catseyes.
**28,400 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
**28,500 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
*Added [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event|PAC-MAN]] and [[River City Ransom Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 15.5 Update|Versions 15.5]] and [[Version 15.6 Update|15.6]] respectively to international versions.
*Renamed "Defense Buff" ability to "HP Buff".
*Renamed [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Unknown Cat]] to "Kesalan Pasalan".
*Increased [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Zeus]]' '''Slow''' Ultra Talent duration from 10f-30f to 24f-60f.
*Added 3 new abilities:
**'''[[Shortened Cooldown]]''' (生産時間短縮 ''Seisan Jikan Tanshuku''). Cats with this ability will have a set % of their recharge time already completed on every other deployment.
**'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff+]]''': An improved, Ultra Talent exclusive version of the HP Buff Talent that increases Unit HP by 10% per level instead of 2%.
**'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff+]]''': Currently unused, though would function the same as HP Buff+ but for the attack power stat instead.
*Updated the following units' descriptions:
**Special Cat: [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Skirt Cat]].
**Rare Cats: [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Pogo Cat]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]], [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]], [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]], [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]], [[Thief Cat (Rare Cat)|Thief Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]], [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Fortune Teller Cat]], [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]], [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Archer Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Bronze Cat]], [[Sports Day Cat (Rare Cat)|Sports Day Cat]], [[Salaryman Cat (Rare Cat)|Salaryman Cat]], [[Reindeer Fish Cat (Rare Cat)|Reindeer Fish Cat]], [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Adult Cat]], [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Evil Cat]], [[Doll Cats (Rare Cat)|Doll Cats]], [[Rope Jump Cat (Rare Cat)|Rope Jump Cat]] and [[Rin the Cat (Rare Cat)|Rin the Cat]].
**Super Rare Cats: [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]], [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]].
**Uber Rare Cats: [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Nekoluga]], [[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Cat]], [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]], [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lesser Demon Cat]], [[Marauder Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Marauder Cat]], [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]], [[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Windy]], [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]], [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]], [[Voli (Uber Rare Cat)|Voli]], [[Fuma Kotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|Fuma Kotaro]] and [[Akane Tounji (Uber Rare Cat)|Akane Tounji]].
*Added a way to see [[Treasure]]s when in stage selection.
*Added Treasure Gauge that will guarantee a Superior Treasure once filled. The Treasure Gauge can be filled by clearing any stage that doesn't cost 0 [[Cat Energy|Energy]] to play, gaining [[User Rank]], and allowing [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] to complete Expeditions.

